Package: SUNbeta13
Type: Package
Title: SUN Beta 1.3 Resolution Recommendation for Seurat SNN Clustering
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "SUN",
           family = "Team",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "omegananodesu@gmail.com")
Description: Provides SUN beta 1.3 for automatic resolution recommendation
    in Seurat SNN graph clustering workflows. The package scans resolution
    intervals, applies plateau-cache aligned interval replacement, scores
    intervals with embedding-based silhouette (bluster::approxSilhouette),
    and returns a recommended resolution with corresponding cluster labels.
